---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="sk">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/taskflow-favicon.svg?v=2" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/taskflow-favicon.svg?v=2" />
		<title>Začať zadarmo | TaskFlow AI</title>
	</head>
	<body class="overflow-x-hidden bg-slate-950 text-slate-50 antialiased">
		<main class="relative flex min-h-screen items-center overflow-hidden px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(99,102,241,0.22),_transparent_34%),radial-gradient(circle_at_80%_20%,_rgba(168,85,247,0.18),_transparent_28%),linear-gradient(to_bottom,_rgba(15,23,42,0.92),_rgba(2,6,23,1))]"></div>
			<div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-indigo-400/40 to-transparent"></div>

			<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-8 shadow-2xl shadow-black/40 backdrop-blur-xl sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-indigo-300">Demo stránka</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
					Táto stránka je len ukážka
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8">
					V tomto deme nie je možné dokončiť registráciu, vytvoriť účet ani pokračovať na ďalší krok. Slúži iba na ukážku
					fungovania landing page.
				</p>

				<div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5">
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Čo tu nájdete</p>
						<p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Ukážkovú verziu bez pokračovania</p>
					</div>
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5">
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Ďalší krok</p>
						<p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Vrátiť sa na hlavnú stránku</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
					<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-500 px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-indigo-400 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-400">
						Späť na hlavnú stránku
					</a>
					<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white transition duration-200 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white/70">
						Pozrieť si demo sekcie
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>